Description: Single-sample PAM50 intrinsic molecular subtyping of breast-cancer
    expression data using the Perou Lab published centroids (Spearman rank
    correlation), with optional Zhao4 subtype-specific quantile centering,
    ROR-S/ROR-P risk scores, intrinsic clustering and claudin-low identification.
    Reference data (centroids, annotation, calibration medians, training set,
    SIGMA quantiles, intrinsic gene list) is bundled so no external checkout is
    required. This packages the exact algorithm the Swarbrick Lab already uses;
    it is not a reimplementation.
